# The build context is sent to the daemon in full before the first instruction
# runs, and this repo carries a 725 MB .venv plus every MLflow backend and the
# built site. Deny everything and admit only what the image actually needs --
# an allowlist, so a large directory added later cannot quietly bloat the build.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src
!scripts
!data_cache

# ...and nothing compiled or cached from inside those.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
